"{\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"AND\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Diagnosis of COPD based on ATS/ERS criteria\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Male or female subjects, aged >=40 years\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Females must be of Non Child Bearing Potential\"\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"Diagnosed COPD stage III or IV according to GOLD criteria\"\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"At least 2 moderate or severe COPD exacerbations within the 12 months preceding Visit 1\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"Stable COPD medication within 4 weeks prior to Visit 1\"\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"right\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"raw_text\": \"Current or ex-smokers with a smoking history of at least 10 pack years\"\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"Currently managed at home (outpatients), ambulatory and able to travel to the clinic\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"A signed and dated written informed consent is obtained prior to participation\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Able to comply with the requirements of the protocol and be available for study visits over 52 weeks\"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"